  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den Litauiska Organisationen &quot;Energy Savings Facilities&quot; (ESF) planerar att producera tv&#xe5; TV-program &#xe9; 25 min, om svenskt st&#xf6;d till Litauen inom milj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det. Programmen skall behandla tv&#xe5; teman: vatten och jordbruk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The public institution &quot;Energy Savings Facilities&quot; is planning to produce two TV-programmes &#xe9; 25 min, regarding Swedish environmental support to Lithuania. The programmes will cover two themes: water and agriculture.</narrative>
